            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fresco 0.4.5</h2>
<pre>
Fresco 0.4.5

• Wallhaven custom searches now include Sketchy and NSFW results when an API key is set, so searching for an artist or model finds all of their wallpapers, not just the few tagged SFW. Without a key, searches stay SFW.
</pre>
]]></description>
