            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fresco 0.4.4</h2>
<pre>
Fresco 0.4.4

• New Schedule tab in Settings: how often the wallpaper changes, and switching mixes by time of day, in one place.
• New About tab, opened from &quot;About Fresco&quot; in the menu. The version now lives there instead of in the menu.
• Settings opens at a size that fits, and no longer resizes between tabs.
• Local Folder says &quot;Folder not found&quot; when its folder was moved or deleted.
• Wikimedia Commons, DeviantArt and Flickr have been removed.
</pre>
]]></description>
