            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Fresco 0.4.2</h2>
<pre>
Fresco 0.4.2

• Update reminders: when a new version is out, a dot appears on the menu-bar icon and &quot;Update Available&quot; at the top of the menu, with a notification if you allow them.
• Settings → General → Updates: check automatically, install automatically, and Check Now.
• New shortcuts: ⌃⌥⌘P puts the previous wallpaper back, ⌃⌥⌘S saves the photo on the display under the pointer. Each can be turned off in Settings → Shortcuts.
• About Photo now appears for every online source, with links to the photo&#x27;s page, its original source, author and license where available.
</pre>
]]></description>
